      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.37,
      "end_seconds": 302.4,
      "duration_seconds": 21.03,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's coeliac disease on a gluten-free diet with some accidental exposure and and we'll watch how it goes. Check labels carefully and use separate toasters and chopping boards. Okay anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.72,
      "end_seconds": 305.09,
